{"title": "Secure cloud storage is the cheaper, safer alternative to keeping files physical", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/16/secure-cloud-storage-cheaper-safer-alternative-keeping-files-physical/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/pCloud-storage.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1400\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Physical storage and memory are only getting more expensive, but that doesn’t mean we need to store any less. The alternative solution is a secure cloud storage platform, and there’s really only one good option.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/16/secure-cloud-storage-cheaper-safer-alternative-keeping-files-physical/#more-735664\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-16T14:00:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-17T19:03:01.972523+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
